# Vue authoring

## File layout

- `{kebab}/index.ts` exporting component + types
- Spec: `{kebab}.spec.ts`
- CE-host lib: `src/lib/custom-element-host.ts`

## Component rules

- **Vue 3 Composition API only** — no Options API in new code
- `defineComponent` or generated native SFC-less render functions from templates
- Props: explicit types with `default` where optional
- `emits` array declared for all CE-backed events
- `v-model:open` for accordion/modal/collapsible

## CE-host pattern

`defineCustomElementHost({ name, tagName, register, attrs, events }, propsDefinition)`:

- Maps Vue props → CE attributes
- Maps CE events → Vue emits
- Complex props via host ref `setProperty` in `onMounted`

## Native Vue components

- Render function or template matching WC BEM + `data-testid`
- `$slots.default` at documented position

## SSR

Guard browser APIs in `onMounted`; render placeholder in SSR (`16-ssr-and-runtime-environment.mdc`).

## Must not

- Options API `export default { props, data }` in new files
- Fork `defineCustomElementHost` per component
- Framework-only exports without manifest

